      "text": "A vintage enamel shop sign hanging above a rain-slick cobblestone street, the sign reads \"NORTHWIND SUPPLY CO.\" in cream serif lettering on deep green, chipped paint, brass rivets, warm window light behind, shallow depth of field, 85mm, photographic"
